-    // below succeeds, so a failed retag can't leave stale cached state.
+    // unchanged, destroy and recreate just the changed VLAN subinterface(s) on
+    // each trunk instead of a full clear_policies() + rebuild of every managed
+    // trunk/access port. If that fails, m_last_applied_* is left untouched here
+    // and only gets updated once the full rebuild below succeeds, so a failed
+    // recreate can't leave stale cached state.
